      <description><![CDATA[
<h2>What's New in OnAir 4.32</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Redesigned the first-launch setup experience.</li>
  <li>OnAir now works without a physical device.</li>
  <li>Improved device code validation.</li>
  <li>Improved configuration screen to not interrupt recording when saving.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
